WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.323
Lesson five. Feelings!

2
00:00:04.272 --> 00:00:11.355
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.307 --> 00:00:14.100
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.290
Today we learn: Feelings! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.745 --> 00:00:22.245
Happy! Say it with me. Happy!

6
00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:29.801
Sad! Say it with me. Sad!

7
00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:37.432
Angry! Say it with me. Angry!

8
00:00:41.565 --> 00:00:45.248
Tired! Say it with me. Tired!

9
00:00:49.157 --> 00:00:53.140
Excited! Say it with me. Excited!

10
00:00:57.059 --> 00:01:00.559
Scared! Say it with me. Scared!

11
00:01:04.539 --> 00:01:08.473
Surprised! Say it with me. Surprised!

12
00:01:12.552 --> 00:01:16.218
Proud! Say it with me. Proud!

13
00:01:20.222 --> 00:01:26.598
Listen. I feel happy today. She feels tired.

14
00:01:26.648 --> 00:01:31.531
Say it with me. I feel happy today. She feels tired.

15
00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:43.777
Smile and be happy because today is a wonderful day! Sometimes we feel scared, and that is okay too.

16
00:01:43.827 --> 00:01:45.267
I like this story!

17
00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:51.429
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.479 --> 00:01:52.629
Angry!

19
00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:58.802
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.002
Scared!

21
00:02:00.971 --> 00:02:07.192
Value corner: Patience. Waiting calmly, even when it's difficult, is a wonderful skill.

22
00:02:07.242 --> 00:02:08.866
I can show patience too!

23
00:02:09.661 --> 00:02:16.689
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:16.739 --> 00:02:18.366
Bye-bye, friends!

